# A planted ledger: the guard function __cxa_guard_acquire with the mark ratchet.
format 1
rule artifact-symbols
configuration planted kind planted
configuration planted tier planted
@build/libcrucible.a | allow | 1 | __cxa_guard_abort | -
@build/libcrucible.a | ratchet | 1 | __cxa_guard_acquire | -
@build/libcrucible.a | allow | 1 | __cxa_guard_release | -
@build/libcrucible.a | allow | 1 | __gxx_personality_v0 | -
